  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.24: parser and PDF fixes. Attribute entries above the document title no longer turn the author line, revision line and later header entries into a paragraph. Attribute references in the document title are resolved. PDF: a page break (<<<) no longer discards the page in progress, and a break on a page with no content is ignored; line breaks inside table cells render as a space; cross-references without a label show the target section or block title instead of its id. See CHANGELOG.md.",
